  "content": {
    "equation": "Infuse Rate:\nWhen Dose is input in g/hr and Drug Amount is input in g:\nInfuse Rate = (Dose) / (Drug Amount / Infusate Volume)\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hr\n• Dose is input in g/hr\n• Drug Amount is input in g\n• Infusate Volume is input in mL\nWhen Dose is input in g/hr and Drug Amount is input in mg:\nInfuse Rate = (Dose * 1000) / (Drug Amount / Infusate Volume)\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hr\n• Dose is input in g/hr\n• Drug Amount is input in mg\n• Infusate Volume is input in mL\nWhen Dose is input in mg/min and Drug Amount is input in mg:\nInfuse Rate = (Dose * 60) / (Drug Amount / Infusate Volume)\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hr\n• Dose is input in mg/min\n• Drug Amount is input in mg\n• Infusate Volume is input in mL\nWhen Dose is input in mg/min and Drug Amount is input in g:\nInfuse Rate = [(Dose * 60) / 1000] / (Drug Amount / Infusate Volume)\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hr\n• Dose is input in mg/min\n• Drug Amount is input in g\n• Infusate Volume is input in mL",
